                "text": "The Big Beautiful Bill is bringing long-overdue Medicaid reform\u2014and it's a game changer.  Florida's most vulnerable populations...low income seniors, disabled adults, children and pregnant women are protected while we root out fraud and corruption that is draining the system.  This isn't just good public policy, it's the right thing to do.  @realDonaldTrump @WhiteHouse  #MedicaidReform #BigBeautifulBill",
