                "text": "I enjoyed speaking with senior advocates at this month\u2019s Pasco Aging Network meeting. It was a valuable opportunity to share the work I am doing in Washington to protect and support our senior citizens. From improving access to healthcare and prescription medications to safeguarding Social Security and enhancing community resources, I am committed to ensuring that our seniors can live with dignity, security, and independence. Thank you to everyone involved for your dedication to advocating for the needs of older adults in our community.",
